{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-9-18","kind":"proposition","title":"构造与求解：比例与整数","englishTitle":"Given two numbers, to investigate whether it is possible to find a third proportional to them.","book":9,"number":18,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.18","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.18/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":18,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-9-18@raw-7eaedb5d016e0884","contentId":"euclid-9-18","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7eaedb5d016e0884d3b7f42709d1668c69e59cce3ddd693e6b7162370e807568","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-9-18.statement","euclid-9-18.construction.1","euclid-9-18.proof.1","euclid-9-18.proof.2","euclid-9-18.proof.3","euclid-9-18.proof.4","euclid-9-18.proof.5","euclid-9-18.proof.6","euclid-9-18.proof.7","euclid-9-18.proof.8","euclid-9-18.proof.9","euclid-9-18.proof.10","euclid-9-18.proof.11","euclid-9-18.proof.12","euclid-9-18.proof.13","euclid-9-18.conclusion","euclid-9-18.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-9-18.statement","contentId":"euclid-9-18","revisionId":"euclid-9-18@raw-7eaedb5d016e0884","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b0aa5dd3e3ffccc3fcbf8e55652b0695fbd9347fdfe37bf6895f8b734d7c96c3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Given two numbers, to investigate whether it is possible to find a third proportional to them."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"有两个号码,调查它们能否找到第三个成比例。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-18.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-9-18","revisionId":"euclid-9-18@raw-7eaedb5d016e0884","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e446a753fd2e5ea69da495ce882e0f962486eea31fdf1c6c3d204d0fb71ccbfa","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A, B be the given two numbers, and let it be required to investigate whether it is possible to find a third proportional to them."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A,B是给定的两个数字,并让调查调查是否有可能找到第三个成比例。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-18.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-9-18","revisionId":"euclid-9-18@raw-7eaedb5d016e0884","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5bbe34a135f5c97efb574f3f91fcb74060a014d824048b50cb17ee1575ec4ea9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now A, B are either prime to one another or not."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在A,B 要么互素,要么不是。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-18.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-9-18","revisionId":"euclid-9-18@raw-7eaedb5d016e0884","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"34db0409c033aa7ff3066c25d2b9d95749ecaca531bbe3b8c55f55a92b974fec","citations":["euclid-9-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, if they are prime to one another, it has been proved that it is impossible to find a third proportional to them. [[IX. 16](/principles/euclid-9-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果它们是互素, 已证明不可能找到第三个成比例。 [[IX. 16](/principles/euclid-9-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-18.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-9-18","revisionId":"euclid-9-18@raw-7eaedb5d016e0884","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4d9bd509c093503c2e7fe1d6f22fa9a749255eba8b935a0018ca5c4521ea455d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Next, let A, B not be prime to one another, and let B by multiplying itself make C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"接下来,A,B 而不是互素,让B 乘以本身就C。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-18.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-9-18","revisionId":"euclid-9-18@raw-7eaedb5d016e0884","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c209eee5cd8c186af0143aca0b3a5bf37fdeb84a051cf5d34791de28c61dc6d9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then A either measures C or does not measure it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A要么整除 C 要么整除 C 要么整除"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-18.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-9-18","revisionId":"euclid-9-18@raw-7eaedb5d016e0884","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"46988e858ad676be6b2f810eb86a259c44a93c3414561cfb51d42469722fc449","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"First, let it measure it according to D; therefore A by multiplying D has made C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"首先,根据D的计算,它为整除,因此,A乘以D, 已经达到C。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-18.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-9-18","revisionId":"euclid-9-18@raw-7eaedb5d016e0884","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3bdc8656b797c4dcb25e881fefeaccecbe5b154f2918b4f08ccb626c2117ef22","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, further, B has also by multiplying itself made C; therefore the product of A, D is equal to the square on B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,还有,B也通过乘以本身而达到C;因此,A,D的产物等于B的平方数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-18.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-9-18","revisionId":"euclid-9-18@raw-7eaedb5d016e0884","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1f2d9e7a6d0de29f391477c434eb98165657f990c8e7ceaed3cdc2eaca493402","citations":["euclid-7-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as A is to B, so is B to D; [[VII. 19](/principles/euclid-7-19)] therefore a third proportional number D has been found to A, B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A对B的比等于B对D的比;因此,发现第三个成比例对D的比为A对B；A 与 B 之比等于 B 与 D 之比。 [[VII. 19](/principles/euclid-7-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-18.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-9-18","revisionId":"euclid-9-18@raw-7eaedb5d016e0884","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"43d7b04938134cadfab44a608959cdfb53f4f74b4fbf479719b7b50445a1e3b5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Next, let A not measure C; I say that it is impossible to find a third proportional number to A, B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"接下来,让A而不是整除 C;我说,不可能找到第三个成比例到A,B的数字。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-18.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-9-18","revisionId":"euclid-9-18@raw-7eaedb5d016e0884","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3bb7d6090d1599c6dcca5c7a1504d2e25d2bd26263c6c55cb6867be7b6fc8079","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if possible, let D, such third proportional, have been found."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果可能的话,就找D,也就是第三成比例"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-18.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-9-18","revisionId":"euclid-9-18@raw-7eaedb5d016e0884","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a28c7c21f305fa06711b13e63e90ed60be172eb10bbe644e9086b73083fe9f53","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the product of A, D is equal to the square on B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A,D的产物等于B的平方数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-18.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-9-18","revisionId":"euclid-9-18@raw-7eaedb5d016e0884","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e15e693a1c3ec513e80eb7ad58f90f830969f6afba8b029307158c3d1cc5fa75","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the square on B is C; therefore the product of A, D is equal to C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但B的平方数是C,A,D的产物等于C。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-18.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-9-18","revisionId":"euclid-9-18@raw-7eaedb5d016e0884","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4a36e674e68174dfaf3e823d4554da066805666caee584e4055434b239f31845","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Hence A by multiplying D has made C; therefore A measures C according to D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A乘以D, 使C;因此,根据D, A 整除 C。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-18.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-9-18","revisionId":"euclid-9-18@raw-7eaedb5d016e0884","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d999b8b9393d3e9850aa378ae96b35b9d2d3419556153817d5c4740db4c385bf","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, by hypothesis, it also does not measure it: which is absurd."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但假设说,它也不是整除,这是荒谬的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-18.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-9-18","revisionId":"euclid-9-18@raw-7eaedb5d016e0884","order":15,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2eb36bd8ccf611c20bcbc4138e7b53e0d31cdca405ba21d6399fe14ad32a2175","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore it is not possible to find a third proportional number to A, B when A does not measure C. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,如果A不是整除 C. 证毕。,则无法找到第三个成比例至A、B的号码。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-18.source","contentId":"euclid-9-18","revisionId":"euclid-9-18@raw-7eaedb5d016e0884","order":16,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"59ab37ec38cf8e6fc4fe46fa7f37e5b0b5753a7546d7ad85717d7afac415a76f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.18/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.18\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-9-18:euclid-9-16:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-9-18","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-9-18.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-9-16","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":